---
import { site } from "../site";
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="letter">
      <div class="photo" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/kunal.png" alt="" width="84" height="96" decoding="async" />
      </div>
      <span class="eyebrow">
        <b>07</b> From the founder
      </span>
      <h2 id="founder-title">Hi, I'm Kunal.</h2>
      <div class="body">
        <p>The agents I build kept hitting one wall: email.</p>
        <p>The hosted inbox APIs were closed, some with webhooks only on top plans. So I'm building an open one.</p>
        <p>Giving agents email? Write to me.</p>
      </div>
      <footer class="sign">
        <div>
          <span class="name">Kunal Dholiya</span>
          <span class="role">Founder, send0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="links mono">
          <a href={site.founderGithub} rel="noopener">
            github.com/kunal-dd
          </a>
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email.hello}`}>{site.email.hello}</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .letter {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 44px 28px 32px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .letter {
      padding: 56px 64px 40px;
    }
  }
  /* Kunal, as the stamp in the corner */
  .photo {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 7px;
    background: var(--stamp-paper);
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgb(60 40 20 / 0.18));
    --r: 3.5px;
    mask:
      radial-gradient(var(--r) at var(--r) var(--r), #0000 97%, #000) calc(-1 * var(--r)) calc(-1 * var(--r)) / 11px 11px round,
      linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box;
  }
  .photo img {
    width: 64px;
    height: 74px;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--sky);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .photo {
      float: right;
      margin: -28px -32px 12px 24px;
      transform: rotate(3deg);
    }
    .photo img {
      width: 84px;
      height: 96px;
    }
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .body {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .body p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 82%, transparent);
  }
  .body p + p {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .sign {
    clear: both;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1.5px dashed var(--rule);
  }
  .name {
    display: block;
    font: 650 22px/1.1 var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .role {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 18px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: var(--rule);
  }
  .links a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
